<level1><h1>Spelling Hints</h1>
<p>The spelling hint "<em>i</em> before <em>e</em>, except after <em>c</em>" isn't very helpful.</p>
<p>A tax on a <strong>gift by a living person</strong> is a <strong><em>Glasnost</em></strong> term.</p>
<p>Words and a <em>whole italic phrase that runs on for several words</em> then plain.</p>
<p>Water is H<sub>2</sub>O and area is measured in m<sup>2</sup>.</p>
<p><em>Entirely italic paragraph.</em></p>
